and enjoy a beloved childhood memory.

362
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:15,220
你看那个小木屋
You see that cabin there?

363
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:19,420
相关资料说  是非法侵占印第安人的土地建的
I read they were illegally squatting on Indian land.

364
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:21,200
是的
Yeah.

365
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:23,040
就个人而言  我觉得我们
Personally, I think what we did

366
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:25,240
对印第安人的所作所为是错的
to the Native Americans was wrong,

367
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:28,740
但这是你最喜欢的电视剧  不是我的
but this is your favorite show, not mine.

368
00:16:28,740 --> 00:16:31,150
你瞧小劳拉·英格尔斯
Oh, look at little Laura Ingalls,

369
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:33,380
居然在吃花生酱三明治
eating that peanut butter sandwich.

370
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,240
花生酱
Peanut butter?!

371
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:40,110
真奇怪  因为花生酱
That's strange, since peanut butter

372
00:16:40,110 --> 00:16:43,650
直到20世纪初才出现
wasn't introduced until the early 1900s.

373
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:47,570
如果早知道这是部时光穿越剧
If I knew this show was about time travel,

374
00:16:47,570 --> 00:16:50,340
我想我早就看了
I would have watched it much sooner.

375
00:16:53,490 --> 00:16:54,600
你是在报复我
You're trying to get back at me

376
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,570
说了《夺宝奇兵》的坏话
for what I said about Raiders of the Lost Ark.

377
00:16:56,570 --> 00:16:58,290
这话真傻
That's silly.

378
00:16:58,290 --> 00:17:01,020
傻到和贝克医生有电话一样
Almost as silly as Dr. Baker having a telephone,

379
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:02,220
因为在那个年代
since telephones only existed

380
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:04,770
只有大城市才有电话
in large cities at that time.

381
00:17:04,770 --> 00:17:07,600
这部剧应该叫做《荒谬之地的小木屋》
This is more like Little House on the Preposterous.

382
00:17:09,060 --> 00:17:11,550
谢尔顿  我们在谈恋爱
Sheldon, we're in a relationship.

383
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:14,130
如果你生气  告诉我就行了
When you get angry, just tell me.

384
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:16,410
你不必偷偷想办法报复
You don't need to seek revenge.

385
00:17:16,410 --> 00:17:18,310
