440
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,440
这真是太惨了
This is the worst.

441
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,500
早知道结果会这样
If we're gonna get shot down,

442
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:45,440
还不如去酒吧
we might as well just go to a bar

443
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:46,440
用老方法泡妞
