448
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:57,740
我错了  这个更惨
I was wrong. This is worse.

449
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:09,360
等等  如果不是因为印第安纳·琼斯
Wait, wait-- if it wasn't for Indiana Jones,

450
